{"type":"message","id":"ad3eb2f3","parentId":"82163079","timestamp":"2026-03-10T05:45:36.551Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user started a new session. According to AGENTS.md, I need to:\n1. Read SOUL.md — this is who I am\n2. Read USER.md — this is who I'm helping\n3. Read memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md (today + yesterday) for recent context\n4. If in MAIN SESSION (direct chat with human): Also read MEMORY.md\n\nI'm in a direct chat (chat_type: \"direct\"), so this is a main session. Let me read the required files.\n\nI already have the content of SOUL.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md, and HEARTBEAT.md from the Project Context.\n\nLooking at them:\n- SOUL.md defines who I am - I should be genuinely helpful, have opinions, be resourceful, earn trust, and remember I'm a guest\n- USER.md is mostly empty - needs to be filled in\n- MEMORY.md is empty (just a header)\n- There's no memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md yet since this is a new workspace\n\nAlso, there's a BOOTSTRAP.md file which means this is a fresh workspace. I should follow the bootstrap process - introduce myself and figure out who I am and who the user is.\n\nLet me check if there are memory files for today or yesterday.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-fd523791394348b186815616e5da596a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot6/memory/2026-03-10.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-cd2c22eb75f54d24a50aaa540451c78b","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot6/memory/2026-03-09.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-plan","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":185,"output":578,"cacheRead":18191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18954,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773121525598}}
